# Studying in Russian: я изуча́ю ру́сский
subtitle: "Say what you study in Russian with я изуча́ю ру́сский, tell it apart from я учу́сь в университе́те, and talk about lessons, homework and passing an exam."
tags: ["russian","studying in russian","изучать","учиться","russian vocabulary"]
teaches: ["vocabulary/studying","grammar/reflexive-verbs"]
thumb: "band \"Only one of them takes Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"On the phone in Russian: алло́, перезвоню́","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/79-russian-phone.cast"}

## Studying in Russian: я изуча́ю ру́сский
