A: Я учу́сь в университе́те: you can say that since lesson sixty-one. Today: what you study, (@draw k_exam@) and the exam at the end of it.
    draw uni k0

    erase uni k0 k_exam

A: First, listen. I ask (@draw masha masha_name@) Masha about tomorrow.
    draw tom tom_name

A: Ма́ша, ты свобо́дна за́втра?
    draw balloon_t caption false

    erase balloon_t

    draw balloon

    ask "What is tomorrow? One word sounds almost like English." voice b options ["a film","an exam","work"] correct 2 reveal.text "Нет, за́втра у меня́ экза́мен." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 600 reveal.style label reveal.size 52 reveal.color #3d3833
        gloss: No, tomorrow I have an exam.
        listen: Нет, за́втра у меня́ экза́мен.
        right: An exam: экза́мен.
        wrong: Listen to the last word: экза́мен.

    erase balloon

    hide tom tom_name masha masha_name

B: Экза́мен: an exam. And I'm a студе́нтка, a student.
    draw w_exam_i w_exam w_she_i w_she

    draw w_he_i w_he

A: A man is a студе́нт; the ка makes it a woman.
    highlight w_she color #b5482e part ка$

A: A class, or a lesson, is a уро́к. Уро́к начина́ется в де́вять.
    draw w_les_i w_les w_les_s

    erase w_les_s

    draw w_hw_i w_hw

B: And after the lesson, дома́шнее зада́ние: homework, the task for home. Дома́шнее, from дом.
    highlight w_hw color #c9871a part ^дом effect underline

    erase w_she_i w_she w_he_i w_he w_exam_i w_exam w_les_i w_les w_hw_i w_hw

A: Now, two verbs for study. Учи́ться you know: я учу́сь в университе́те. It answers где, where.
    draw v_l l1 h_where

B: Изуча́ть is new: я изуча́ю ру́сский, I study Russian. It answers что, what.
    draw v_r r1 h_what

A: Ру́сский here is the language itself, and англи́йский is English; по-ру́сски, you know, means in Russian.
    highlight r1 color #c9871a part ру́сский effect underline

A: Изуча́ть goes like чита́ю: я изуча́ю, ты изуча́ешь, она́ изуча́ет.
    draw r2

    erase r2

    draw r3

B: And the what-word takes its у, as in чита́ю кни́гу: я изуча́ю му́зыку. Ру́сский stays the same, like дом.
    highlight r3 color #c9871a part у$ effect underline

A: Here's why. Учи́ться has lesson sixty-one's ся, so it can't take a what-word in that у-ending case.
    highlight v_l color #b0476b part ся$

B: So not я учу́сь ру́сский, but я изуча́ю ру́сский.
    draw bad bad_x

    erase r3

    quiz "Your turn: Я … в шко́ле. Which verb?" store chk voice a
        right: Учу́сь: в шко́ле says where.
        wrong: В шко́ле is a where, not a what.
        + учу́сь
        * изуча́ю

    erase bad bad_x

    hide cols

B: Я должна́ сде́лать дома́шнее зада́ние. За́втра экза́мен.
    draw m2 h1 h2

A: To pass an exam is сдать экза́мен. Я сдам, I'll pass: (@draw p2@) a done-future like сде́лаю, but short and odd: сдам, сдашь.
    draw p1

B: And afterwards, happy: я сдала́ экза́мен! With a woman's а, as in была́.
    text p3 "я сдала́!" say "я сдала́!" say_voice b colors {"а$":"#b5482e"} x 720 y 245 font_size 52

    erase m2 h1 h2 p1 p2 p3

A: Now Masha is busy, and Tom wants to go out. Listen, then practise it.
    show masha masha_name tom tom_name

    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Ма́ша, дава́й пойдём в парк!","gloss":"Masha, let's go to the park!"},{"by":"b","text":"Не могу́. Я должна́ сде́лать дома́шнее зада́ние.","gloss":"I can't. I have to do my homework."},{"by":"a","text":"Дома́шнее зада́ние? Ты ещё студе́нтка?","gloss":"Homework? You're still a student?"},{"by":"b","text":"Да, я учу́сь в университе́те.","gloss":"Yes, I study at the university."},{"by":"a","text":"А что ты изуча́ешь?","gloss":"And what do you study?"},{"by":"b","text":"Англи́йский. А за́втра у меня́ экза́мен.","gloss":"English. And tomorrow I have an exam."},{"by":"a","text":"Ты сдашь, я зна́ю!","gloss":"You'll pass, I know it!"},{"by":"b","text":"Спаси́бо! Е́сли сдам, в суббо́ту пойдём в парк!","gloss":"Thanks! If I pass, we'll go to the park on Saturday!"}] practice true size 1.4

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

    icon q_flag size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["closed book"] icon_look picture of books

    quiz "Я ___ ру́сский. Which verb fits?" above q_flag reveal.text "Я изуча́ю ру́сский." reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Изуча́ю: ру́сский is a what.
        wrong: Ру́сский is a what-word; the ся verb takes no у-ending what-word.
        * учу́сь
        + изуча́ю

    erase q_flag

    icon q_she size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["woman"] icon_look picture of "woman student"

    quiz "A woman at the university says: Я …" above q_she reveal.text "Я студе́нтка." reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Студе́нтка: the ка for a woman.
        wrong: A woman: the word with ка.
        + студе́нтка
        * студе́нт
        * студе́нты

    erase q_she

    icon q_cap size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["party popper"] icon_look picture of "graduation cap"

    quiz "What does Я сдала́ экза́мен! mean?" above q_cap say_answer false reveal.text "I passed the exam!" reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Сдала́: passed, with a woman's а.
        wrong: Сдала́ ends like была́: it already happened.
        * I'll pass the exam.
        * I have an exam.
        + I passed the exam!

    erase q_cap

    icon q_hw size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["house with garden"] icon_look picture of house

    ask "A woman can't go out tonight. Say why, for her." voice b show cue test t1
        gloss: I have to do my homework.
        say_it: Я должна́ сде́лать дома́шнее зада́ние.

B: Я должна́ сде́лать дома́шнее зада́ние.
    text q_say "Я должна́ сде́лать дома́шнее зада́ние." say "Я должна́ сде́лать дома́шнее зада́ние." say_voice b x 500 y 300 font_size 50

    erase q_hw q_say

    icon q_tom size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["man"] icon_look picture of "man student"

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. Type: I study Russian." above q_tom answer ["я изучаю русский","изучаю русский","я изучаю русский язык","я учу русский","учу русский","я учу русский язык"] reveal.text "Я изуча́ю ру́сский." reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Я изуча́ю ру́сский: a what, so изуча́ю.
        wrong: Start with я, then the verb that takes a what-word, then ру́сский.

    erase q_tom

    show cols

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So учу́сь says where you study, изуча́ю says what; the ся verb takes no у-ending what-word.
    highlight l1 r1 color #c9871a effect underline

    hide cols

B: Суббо́та! Я сдала́ экза́мен! Пока́!
    text end_day "суббо́та" #8f887c x 500 y 640 font_size 44
    icon end_masha size 160 set twemoji x 300 y 470 or ["woman"] icon_look picture of "woman student"
    icon end_cap size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["party popper"] icon_look picture of "graduation cap"
    icon end_park size 150 set twemoji x 700 y 470 or ["deciduous tree","evergreen tree"] icon_look picture of "national park"
    text end_say "Я сдала́ экза́мен! Пока́!" say "Суббо́та! Я сдала́ экза́мен! Пока́!" say_voice b x 500 y 290 font_size 60

    erase end_day end_masha end_cap end_park end_say

A: Next time: the phone, and messages.
    box next79 "Next: lesson 79 · алло́" say алло́ x 500 y 430 width 640 height 130 radius 14 font_size 44

